			<CellData>#ff8080</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="plbc10_02_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ヒロコ『すみなれた　ばしょを　はなれ
みしらぬ　ばしょで　しんせいかつ！▽
おんなのこ　なら　あこがれるよね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:15" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:15" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ヒロコ『住み慣れた　場所を　離れ
見知らぬ　場所で　新生活！▽
女の子なら　あこがれるよね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:15" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:15" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>新しい＋新生活は、くどい</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:15" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>GIRL3
ヒロコ</Text>
