			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:15" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="plbc10_15_05"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>なんと！　じんせいの
せんぱいからの　たのみだぞ！？▽
きがむいたら　たのんだぞ　わかもの</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:15" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:15" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>なんと！　人生の
先輩からの　頼みだぞ！？▽
気が向いたら　頼んだぞ　若者</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:15" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:15" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>年寄り→人生の先輩</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:15" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>GENTLEMAN
ツネカズ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:15" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:15" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="plbc10_15_06"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>すまん！▼
すっかり　わすれておったが
せんやくが　あったの　だった</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:15" />
